# {{Workflow Name}}

Run the workflow entrypoint, which calls the shared embedded runtime. Do not reconstruct the business flow with separate tool calls.

## Execute

```bash
python scripts/{{workflow}}.py --{{id_param}} {{value}} --idempotency-key {{key}} --dry-run
python scripts/{{workflow}}.py --{{id_param}} {{value}} --idempotency-key {{same-key}}
```

For dangerous effects, show the dry-run result and obtain explicit confirmation before the second command.

## Parameters

| Parameter | Meaning | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| `--{{id_param}}` | {{meaning}} | {{format/values}} |
